",["msg_0635_T30R0601_00048"]],["WaitButton",[]],["CloseMsg",[]],["TouchscreenMenuShow",[]],["ReleaseAll",[]],["End",[]],["NPCMsg",["msg_0635_T30R0601_00049"]],["WaitButton",[]],["CloseMsg",[]],["TouchscreenMenuShow",[]],["ReleaseAll",[]],["End",[]],["NPCMsg",["msg_0635_T30R0601_00050"]],["WaitButton",[]],["CloseMsg",[]],["TouchscreenMenuShow",[]],["ReleaseAll",[]],["End",[]],["NPCMsg",["msg_0635_T30R0601_00051"]],["WaitButton",[]],["CloseMsg",[]],["TouchscreenMenuShow",[]],["ReleaseAll",[]],["End",[]],["PlaySE",["SEQ_SE_DP_SELECT"]],["LockAll",[]],["NPCMsg",["msg_0635_T30R0601_00061"]],["WaitButton",[]],["CloseMsg",[]],["ReleaseAll",[]],["End",[]]]},"messages":{"msg_0635_T30R0601_00000":"Um...\\nWho did you say I was again?\\r...\\n...\\rOh, yes, I remember now!\\nI’m the Move Deleter!\\r","msg_0635_T30R0601_00001":"You’ve come to make me force your\\nPokémon to forget some moves? {YESNO 0}","msg_0635_T30R0601_00002":"Which Pokémon should forget a move?\\r","msg_0635_T30R0601_00003":"Remember me if there are moves that\\nneed to be forgotten.","msg_0635_T30R0601_00004":"That Pokémon knows only one move,\\nso it can’t be forgotten...\\r","msg_0635_T30R0601_00005":"What? That’s an Egg.\\nNo Egg should know any moves.\\r","msg_0635_T30R0601_00006":"OK, then.\\nWhich move should be forgotten?\\r","msg_0635_T30R0601_00007":"Hm! The move {STRVAR_1 6, 0, 0}?\\nShould that move be forgotten? {YESNO 0}","msg_0635_T30R0601_00008":"It worked perfectly!\\rYour Pokémon has forgotten the move\\n{STRVAR_1 6, 0, 0} completely.","msg_0635_T30R0601_00009":"Me?\\nI’m the Pokémon Move Maniac.\\rI know every move that Pokémon learn\\nwhile they’re leveling up, and I can\\fmake Pokémon remember those moves.\\rI can make a Pokémon of yours remember\\na move if you’d like.\\rBut...ahem! It’ll cost you.\\rI’ll make a Pokémon remember a move\\nif you’ll trade me a Heart Scale.","msg_0635_T30R0601_00010":"Ha! That’s it! That’s an honest-to-\\ngoodness Heart Scale!\\rLet me guess, you want me to teach\\none of your Pokémon a move?\\r","msg_0635_T30R0601_00011":"If any of your Pokémon needs to learn a\\nmove, come back with a Heart Scale.","msg_0635_T30R0601_00012":"Which Pokémon needs tutoring?\\r","msg_0635_T30R0601_00013":"Which move should I make it remember?\\r","msg_0635_T30R0601_00014":"Sorry...\\rThere isn’t any move I can make\\nthat Pokémon remember.","msg_0635_T30R0601_00015":"Hunh?\\rDon’t you think it’d be tough for\\nan Egg to remember a move?\\rIt’s not even hatched.","msg_0635_T30R0601_00016":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00017":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00018":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00019":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00020":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00021":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00022":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00023":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00024":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00025":"{STRVAR_1 3, 3, 0} handed over one\\nHeart Scale in exchange.","msg_0635_T30R0601_00026":"Hohoho...\\nThey call me Grandma Wilma.\\rI sense a slight talent as a\\nDragon Tamer in you.\\rWould you like me to teach a move\\nto one of your Pokémon? {YESNO 0}","msg_0635_T30R0601_00027":"Ah, it is you again...\\rWould you like me to teach the best\\nDragon-type move I know to one of\\fyour Pokémon? {YESNO 0}","msg_0635_T30R0601_00028":"Well, perhaps if you change your\\nmind, do come back.","msg_0635_T30R0601_00029":"I see...\\nI like your sense of adventure.\\rHowever, none of the Pokémon with\\nyou now can learn the move.","msg_0635_T30R0601_00030":"Fine, fine, now pick the Pokémon\\nI should teach the move to.\\r","msg_0635_T30R0601_00031":"Sorry to disappoint you...\\rThat Pokémon you have can learn this\\nmove, but it hasn’t come to trust\\fyou fully yet...\\rUntil then, I can’t make it learn\\nthis move.","msg_0635_T30R0601_00032":"Sorry to disappoint you...\\nThat Pokémon can’t learn this move.","msg_0635_T30R0601_00033":"Hmm...\\rTeaching a move to an Egg is\\na challenge that’s beyond me.","msg_0635_T30R0601_00034":"Oh? That Pokémon already\\nknows {STRVAR_1 6, 0, 0}.","msg_0635_T30R0601_00035":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00036":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00037":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00038":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00039":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00040":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00041":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00042":"Draco Meteor’s destructive power\\nis awe inspiring.\\rHowever, using it will also lower\\nthe user’s Special Attack.","msg_0635_T30R0601_00043":"Your quest for power has brought\\nyou here...\\rVery well.\\rLet me reward your passion with some\\nabsolutely astounding moves.\\rThey’re the ultimate moves!\\rShall I teach them to\\nyour Pokémon? {YESNO 0}","msg_0635_T30R0601_00044":"The ultimate moves!\\rShall I teach them to\\nyour Pokémon? {YESNO 0}","msg_0635_T30R0601_00045":"To which Pokémon should I teach\\na move?\\r","msg_0635_T30R0601_00046":"Hmm... Well, that is fine, as well.\\nVisit if you have a change of heart.","msg_0635_T30R0601_00047":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00048":"That Pokémon can’t learn a move!\\nRead the memo there! Keh!","msg_0635_T30R0601_00049":"Teach a move to an Egg?\\nImpossible even for me! Keh!","msg_0635_T30R0601_00050":"You’ve not bonded strongly enough\\nwith your Pokémon! Keh!","msg_0635_T30R0601_00051":"That Pokémon already knows the move\\nI’ve offered to teach! Keh!","msg_0635_T30R0601_00052":"I should teach Blast Burn to\\nyour {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}? {YESNO 0}","msg_0635_T30R0601_00053":"I should teach Hydro Cannon to\\nyour {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}? {YESNO 0}","msg_0635_T30R0601_00054":"I should teach Frenzy Plant to\\nyour {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}? {YESNO 0}","msg_0635_T30R0601_00055":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00056":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00057":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00058":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00059":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00060":"","msg_0635_T30R0601_00061":"To the Pokémon listed here,\\nthe ultimate moves may be taught!\\rThe blazing Fire-type Pokémon\\n{CURSOR_X 7}CHARIZARD TYPHLOSION\\f{CURSOR_X 7}BLAZIKEN INFERNAPE\\rThe restless Water-type Pokémon\\n{CURSOR_X 7}BLASTOISE FERALIGATR\\f{CURSOR_X 7}SWAMPERT EMPOLEON\\rThe quiet Grass-type Pokémon\\n{CURSOR_X 7}VENUSAUR MEGANIUM\\f{CURSOR_X 7}SCEPTILE TORTERRA","msg_0635_T30R0601_00062":"Well then, I will teach {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}\\na move...\\r"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T30R0601_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_T30R0601_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_T30R0601_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_T30R0601_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_T30R0601_004":4,"obj_T30R0601_gsmiddleman1":0,"obj_T30R0601_gsbigman":1,"obj_T30R0601_gsoldman1":2,"obj_T30R0601_gsoldwoman1":3,"obj_T30R0601_babyboy1_2":4}}
